    <unit id="AboutDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>A cross-platform NES (Famicom) emulator built on the AtomUI ecosystem. Cycle-accurate 6502 CPU and dot-accurate PPU, verified with nestest and the blargg test ROM suites; the UI is built entirely with AtomUI controls.</source>
        <target state="translated">基于 AtomUI 生态构建的跨平台 NES（FC）模拟器。周期精确的 6502 CPU 与逐点 PPU，通过 nestest 及 blargg 系列测试 ROM 验证，界面完全由 AtomUI 组件打造。</target>
      </segment>
